WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.260
- Hello teachers,

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:04.800
I'm Sal Khan, founder of the
not-for-profit Khan Academy,

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.470
and I'm here to announce a nationwide

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:11.518
back to school learning
challenge called LearnStorm.

00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:14.300
LearnStorm is an exciting
way to jump start

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.410
your school year around
learning activities.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.610
It's designed to motivate your students

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:22.420
and to help build their growth mindset.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.490
- This year was amazing with LearnStorm,

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.610
I had a group of students
that couldn't add,

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.090
subtract, multiply, or divide fractions.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.380
They avoided it at all costs,

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.180
but since it was an assignment,

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.670
they would try it and they
would eventually do much better.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:40.100
And what was amazing was that
the lower achieving students

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.300
were able to see that they
were part of something huge.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.080
They were able to contribute,
(cheering)

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.400
and that, I thought, boosted
their self-confidence,

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.480
their self-esteem, and I didn't realize

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.948
that would happen after
doing a LearnStorm.

00:00:53.948 --> 00:00:54.781
(cheering)
(clapping)

00:00:54.781 --> 00:00:57.781
(warm bouncy music)

00:00:59.009 --> 00:01:03.070
- LearnStorm is a good
way to differentiate

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:05.300
and as well as motivate.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.510
And with the growth mindset pieces,

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:10.580
you can also educate them about

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:11.910
why it's important to learn,

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:15.150
how they learn, how their
body is set up to learn,

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:17.470
what strategies help them learn.

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:20.035
It's amazing, it's amazing and it's free!

00:01:20.035 --> 00:01:21.168
(laughing)

00:01:21.168 --> 00:01:22.740
It's free!

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:25.180
- We think this is really
going to motivate your students

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.900
to understand, to
appreciate that they truly

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:29.770
can learn learn anything.

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:31.890
The activities have been designed

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:35.210
to have measurable gains
in learning attitudes.

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:37.860
- One thing I learned from
the growth mindset activities

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.350
is that your intelligence can grow

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:41.700
just like your muscles can grow

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.000
and that's something that
really stuck with me.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.480
'Cause I didn't know that before.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:49.200
- I did over 300 lessons in one week.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:52.240
I felt proud of myself, getting
all of these good grades.

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:54.730
- It helps the students tremendously,

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:56.260
their confidence is higher,

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:58.370
they're able to do it
and it warms my heart

00:01:58.370 --> 00:01:59.980
that they think that way now.

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:02.110
And they know that they can keep going

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:05.860
and keep growing and nothing
will stand in their way.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:08.570
- So together, as we jump
start the school year,

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:12.450
I look forward for all of us
living the LearnStorm motto,

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:15.547
to keep going and to keep growing.

00:02:15.547 --> 00:02:19.464
(all chanting "Go and cheat!")

